    11	// vitest.config.ts, Tier 1 test config this task cannot touch. Mocking the smallest surface
    12	// (ZimmIcon itself) routes around it without losing anything this test actually asserts on —
    13	// the aria-label/href under test come from ZimmContactIconRow's own wrapper, not from ZimmIcon.
